      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "WisprSync's data model is easiest to understand in two stages: the shape Wispr Flow stores locally, and the shape WisprSync exports for ownership, search, validation, and analysis. This section keeps those shapes separate so source facts do not blur into output contracts."
        }
      ],
